th tiled floor, partially tiled walls, bath with shower attachment over, wc, wash hand basin, heated towel rail, shelved storage, window to side, extractor fan\n\nLevel 2 - \n\n\nLanding - \nWith Velux rooflight\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.94m x 3.72m\nWith laminate flooring, dual windows overlooking the front, Stira to attic, door to jack and jill shower room\n\nMain bedroom - 3.88m x 5.65m\nWith high vaulted ceiling with Velux roof light, picture window taking in incredible panoramic views of Dublin Bay including Dublin City, Poolbeg chimneys across to Howth, door to;\n\nWalk-in wardrobe, - 3.00m x 1.84m\nWith fitted railed and shelved storage, Velux rooflight, recessed lighting, door to;\n\nJack and Jill shower room - 1.93m x 1.84m\nWith fully tiled walls and floors, wc, ceramic bowl sink set onto vanity unit, shower cubicle, window to front and extractor fan\n\n"
